3. Third-party material keeps its own license:
   - Networks, prompts and logs from https://github.com/RikiyaT/lm_understand-logs are CC BY 4.0,
     by the authors of "Sparks of Weight-Space Programming". They are fetched into data/ at run time.
     lander/prompt.md follows the structure and the edits format of their Experiment 5 prompt.
     results/exp1-* quote weights from their networks.
   - MinAtar, by Kenny Young and Tian Tian, is GPL-3.0. This repository imports it at run time and
     does not include it. Prompts that quote its source are fetched into data/ and are not committed.
     A distribution that bundles MinAtar must follow GPL-3.0.

